        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Quarry tile, at plant
No losses and no waste water are taken into account.;
UUID: d5506d93-1e3f-3a09-aa0a-b4fda057fe21
includes the raw material normal concrete which is poured into a mould, air-dryed and packed. Some transports and infrastructure are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: typical technology for Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: See geography
